  <g id="p10c" transform="translate(5110,30500)" data-frame="10C Role-based access and PAM: delivery plan and validation">
    <rect data-type="frame" x="0" y="0" width="3152" height="1910" fill="#ffffff" data-title="10C Role-based access and PAM: delivery plan and validation" />
    <textArea id="p10c-title" x="64" y="64" width="3024" height="64" fill="#1a1a1a" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left" font-weight="bold">10C Role-based access and PAM: delivery plan and validation</textArea>
    <textArea id="p10c-subtitle" x="64" y="148" width="3024" height="40" fill="#595959" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="22" text-align="left" font-weight="normal">Identity / platform and access owners / team leads / QA | Draft | Define baseline and entitlements, prove the complete grant lifecycle, then reduce unnecessary standing privilege.</textArea>
    <textArea id="p10c-legend" x="64" y="1750" width="3024" height="40" fill="#595959" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="18" text-align="left" font-weight="normal">Blue = proposed | Gray = reported context or reference | Yellow = exception, boundary or team decision</textArea>
    <textArea id="c-work" x="64" y="244" width="3024" height="40" fill="#1a1a1a" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="22" text-align="left" font-weight="bold">Proposed work packages</textArea>
    <rect id="c-needs" x="64" y="328" width="636" height="256" data-content="&lt;b&gt;1. Agree baseline and elevated tasks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Map jobs/groups to normal target access.&lt;br&gt;Identify tasks needing extra temporary privilege.&lt;br&gt;Review direct, inherited and overlapping grants.&lt;br&gt;Use 08/09 identity and mapping requirements." fill="#a0c4fb" stroke="#6a8bbf" stroke-width="2" data-text-color="#14315e" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="22" data-text-align="left" data-text-align-vertical="middle" />
    <textArea id="c-needs-owner" x="64" y="616" width="636" height="40" fill="#595959" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="18" text-align="left" font-weight="normal">Proposed owner: Team leads + identity + target owners</textArea>
    <rect id="c-design" x="860" y="328" width="636" height="256" data-content="&lt;b&gt;2. Design a target-specific catalog&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Define purpose, roles, scope and eligible identities.&lt;br&gt;Agree approval, justification and duration policy.&lt;br&gt;Assign owners, audit and removal requirements.&lt;br&gt;Choose a supported mechanism for each target." fill="#a0c4fb" stroke="#6a8bbf" stroke-width="2" data-text-color="#14315e" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="22" data-text-align="left" data-text-align-vertical="middle" />
    <textArea id="c-design-owner" x="860" y="616" width="636" height="40" fill="#595959" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="18" text-align="left" font-weight="normal">Proposed owner: Access + identity + platform owners</textArea>
    <rect id="c-pilot" x="1656" y="328" width="636" height="256" data-content="&lt;b&gt;3. Prove one limited entitlement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Test ineligible, pending and declined requests.&lt;br&gt;Verify active scope before the approved task.&lt;br&gt;Exercise expiry, supported revocation and delays.&lt;br&gt;Prove denial afterwards and audit completeness." fill="#a0c4fb" stroke="#6a8bbf" stroke-width="2" data-text-color="#14315e" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="22" data-text-align="left" data-text-align-vertical="middle" />
    <textArea id="c-pilot-owner" x="1656" y="616" width="636" height="40" fill="#595959" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="18" text-align="left" font-weight="normal">Proposed owner: Platform owner + requester/approver + QA</textArea>
    <rect id="c-rollout" x="2452" y="328" width="636" height="256" data-content="&lt;b&gt;4. Expand and review standing access&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Roll out reviewed entitlements in controlled scope.&lt;br&gt;Remove replaced standing grants after validation.&lt;br&gt;Publish request, support and recovery runbooks.&lt;br&gt;Review eligibility, usage and lingering access." fill="#a0c4fb" stroke="#6a8bbf" stroke-width="2" data-text-color="#14315e" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="22" data-text-align="left" data-text-align-vertical="middle" />
    <textArea id="c-rollout-owner" x="2452" y="616" width="636" height="40" fill="#595959" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="18" text-align="left" font-weight="normal">Proposed owner: Target + identity owners + team leads</textArea>
